WEBVTT

00:41.470 --> 00:45.690
Spice and Wolf

00:45.690 --> 00:46.810
Spice and Wolf

00:46.810 --> 00:52.150
Spice and Wolf

02:10.350 --> 02:14.360
<b>Episode 12
Price of Betrayal
and Price of Gold</b>

02:29.890 --> 02:31.630
Is this our touching reunion?

02:33.260 --> 02:34.250
Holo!

02:35.030 --> 02:37.010
You look terrible.

02:37.010 --> 02:38.190
They betrayed us.

02:38.190 --> 02:39.580
I know.

02:43.720 --> 02:48.600
I am not good-natured enough 
to think this was merely a tumble.

02:48.600 --> 02:50.450
Y-Yeah...

02:56.290 --> 02:57.750
Goodness.

02:57.750 --> 03:01.330
There was no need to do all of this. 
I would have come to you in time.

03:08.180 --> 03:10.130
You are a strange one.

03:10.130 --> 03:12.540
The only thing you treated
 with care was my cloak.

03:12.540 --> 03:15.670
You must have something you wish to say to me.

03:15.670 --> 03:19.210
But let me speak first.

03:19.730 --> 03:23.050
I may kill humans.

03:24.260 --> 03:27.700
I believed I could not continue 
my carefree journey with you

03:27.700 --> 03:31.310
without the success of this plan.

03:31.950 --> 03:35.150
That is why I kept my patience.

03:35.150 --> 03:37.610
I am the Wise Wolf Holo.

03:37.970 --> 03:41.740
I can casually forgive 
the arrogance of a youngster.

03:47.540 --> 03:48.170
You...

03:48.170 --> 03:49.760
Forget about that.

03:49.760 --> 03:57.750
I am the Wise Wolf Holo. I am not that 
angry about getting on my knees.

03:58.330 --> 04:01.170
But what is this?

04:01.710 --> 04:04.410
You are a dim-witted fool!

04:04.410 --> 04:07.510
Look at your unbearable state!

04:07.510 --> 04:12.480
Yet, you still carefully folded my cloak 
and protected it from the rain.

04:12.880 --> 04:16.900
What an utter fool! Unsaveable!

04:18.410 --> 04:21.780
How unbelievably good-natured!

04:24.390 --> 04:28.780
Now, Lawrence, we must 
make haste to Ruvinheigen.

04:29.160 --> 04:32.290
The leader must 
take responsibility for betrayal.

04:32.290 --> 04:34.040
That is the way of the world.

04:34.040 --> 04:36.580
No, we have to find Liebert 
and the others first.

04:36.580 --> 04:39.380
Remerio Trading plans to kill Nora!

04:39.380 --> 04:43.220
Nora will definitely be saved 
if you go and rescue her!

04:43.220 --> 04:44.170
Is that so?

04:44.500 --> 04:45.340
Of course!

04:45.340 --> 04:48.930
Even a hundred fully armed men 
would be no problem for you!

04:50.710 --> 04:52.770
That is not the problem.

04:52.770 --> 04:54.830
Then what is?!

04:55.670 --> 04:59.860
I am a wolf. She is a shepherd.

04:59.860 --> 05:02.930
It is impossible for one to welcome the other.

05:02.930 --> 05:04.460
You're still hung up on that?

05:04.460 --> 05:05.650
Do you not understand?

05:05.650 --> 05:10.160
The moment that girl and her dog see me as 
a wolf, they will think I am their enemy!

05:11.140 --> 05:14.130
I would be in no position to save her life.

05:16.170 --> 05:18.040
Even so, could you do it?

05:18.360 --> 05:22.760
I can't turn a blind eye when I know 
someone will be unjustly murdered!

05:22.760 --> 05:24.290
Of course, I will thank you for it!

05:25.010 --> 05:26.060
How so?

05:26.060 --> 05:28.200
As long as you don't ask for Nora's life...

05:28.200 --> 05:31.310
I will do everything I can 
to fulfill your wish!

05:39.100 --> 05:40.270
Holo...

05:43.150 --> 05:45.490
Do not whimper so.

05:46.150 --> 05:47.860
Here, hold this.

05:47.860 --> 05:49.540
Will you do it?

05:49.540 --> 05:51.610
Only on one condition.

05:52.070 --> 05:55.730
I cannot guarantee the lives of those 
who have gotten on my nerves.

05:55.730 --> 05:57.520
That, you must understand.

05:57.520 --> 05:58.620
That's fine.

05:59.060 --> 06:02.210
Even so, I believe in you.

06:02.210 --> 06:04.670
That tongue of yours 
has become quite eloquent...

06:09.470 --> 06:13.060
I have gotten quite a troublesome 
companion for my journey.

06:14.680 --> 06:16.730
Come, where are your praises?

06:16.980 --> 06:20.050
Oh! What a stunning tail!

06:20.050 --> 06:22.730
A little wooden, but acceptable.

06:25.290 --> 06:26.240
Now, then.

06:26.870 --> 06:28.890
Close your eyes for a moment.

06:28.890 --> 06:29.980
All right.

06:43.350 --> 06:45.210
Come. Get on.

06:45.610 --> 06:48.820
You cannot hurt me no matter 
how tightly you grasp my fur.

06:48.820 --> 06:50.890
Do not hold back when climbing up.

06:52.170 --> 06:52.930
Got it.

06:53.200 --> 06:55.890
If you fall off, I will carry you 
with my mouth.

06:56.310 --> 06:57.890
I'll make sure not to fall off.

06:58.410 --> 06:59.240
You know...

06:59.240 --> 07:00.300
What is it?

07:00.300 --> 07:03.480
I truly do hate shepherds.

07:04.370 --> 07:05.460
It'll be fine.

07:05.910 --> 07:10.140
Whether this smuggling operation succeeds 
or fails, Nora will quit being a shepherd.

07:11.410 --> 07:12.460
To thank me...

07:15.020 --> 07:18.240
You must provide me with more 
honey-pickled peaches than I can eat!

07:42.330 --> 07:43.810
Hey, we are getting close.

07:45.330 --> 07:46.320
Yeah.

07:48.820 --> 07:52.700
I will jump over them. 
You must get off quickly.

07:52.700 --> 07:53.700
Got it.

08:12.550 --> 08:13.220
Come on.

08:15.090 --> 08:16.970
Leave the rest to me.

08:16.970 --> 08:17.800
Yeah.

08:23.250 --> 08:24.560
Wh-What's that?!

08:24.560 --> 08:25.660
No way...

08:26.060 --> 08:27.520
A w-wolf?!

08:38.140 --> 08:38.870
There she is!

08:38.870 --> 08:41.160
Protect the shepherd and sheep!

08:52.860 --> 08:55.810
Sh-Sh-Shepherd! Protect me!

08:58.260 --> 08:59.710
You must protect me!

09:03.230 --> 09:07.770
Shepherd! If you protect me, 
I will pay you three hundred Lumione!

09:10.080 --> 09:11.310
I leave it to you!

09:21.780 --> 09:22.540
This is bad!

10:31.580 --> 10:33.220
Enek, stop!

10:44.610 --> 10:45.490
Ms. Nora!

10:45.920 --> 10:46.700
Huh?

10:47.980 --> 10:49.250
Thank goodness you're safe!

10:49.250 --> 10:51.350
What are you doing here?

10:53.750 --> 10:57.290
That wolf is Holo. My companion.

10:57.290 --> 10:58.090
Huh?

11:01.490 --> 11:02.840
You didn't kill him?

11:02.840 --> 11:05.970
Though I thought about swallowing him whole...

11:05.970 --> 11:08.900
Gold would not sit well in my stomach.

11:11.970 --> 11:12.950
This must be it.

11:16.270 --> 11:21.260
U-Um! Wh-why are you 
still alive Mr. Lawrence?

11:21.260 --> 11:26.450
The m-merchants said 
you were both eaten by wolves...

11:26.450 --> 11:28.200
Ms. Nora, actually...

11:28.200 --> 11:30.830
M-Monster! Don't come any closer!

11:34.380 --> 11:36.590
Good evening, Mr. Liebert.

11:38.150 --> 11:39.910
Wh-Why are you still...

11:41.660 --> 11:44.310
Holo. Honey-pickled peaches.

11:47.330 --> 11:50.020
I wasn't the one who
betrayed you! It was Remerio!

11:50.750 --> 11:53.160
I told him we shouldn't do it! 
I was against it!

11:53.160 --> 11:57.770
Please think of this wolf 
as a proxy sent by our almighty God.

11:57.770 --> 11:59.050
Lying will not work against her.

12:01.430 --> 12:04.480
The amount we needed to pay you was too high!

12:04.480 --> 12:07.780
As things stood, our own debts 
would eat up the remaining profit!

12:08.120 --> 12:10.040
Remerio told me to do something about it!

12:10.040 --> 12:12.000
I had no choice but to act!

12:12.000 --> 12:16.170
You're also... You're also a merchant like me!

12:16.820 --> 12:18.040
We're not the same!

12:22.300 --> 12:25.380
Remerio Trading has betrayed us.

12:25.900 --> 12:28.220
They planned to kill you as well, Ms. Nora.

12:29.190 --> 12:33.270
Everything did seem a little strange. 
So that's how it was.

12:34.190 --> 12:35.150
Now, then.

12:35.150 --> 12:38.540
This gold is worth six hundred Lumione coins.

12:38.540 --> 12:40.530
We've been betrayed.

12:40.530 --> 12:44.730
We could give up the smuggling 
and just run with the gold.

12:46.830 --> 12:47.980
However...

12:47.980 --> 12:49.120
However?

12:49.540 --> 12:51.810
It's true that we wouldn't 
have been able to get this gold

12:51.810 --> 12:54.660
without the funds from Remerio Trading.

12:55.820 --> 12:58.080
And, if we run away with this gold,

12:58.470 --> 13:01.380
they will go completely bankrupt.

13:02.460 --> 13:03.290
So...

13:04.390 --> 13:05.550
Holo!

13:06.010 --> 13:09.780
Things aren't over after getting 
revenge on them for their betrayal.

13:10.620 --> 13:13.100
We'll have to continue living after that.

13:13.510 --> 13:16.940
Then, they may come after us 
to get their own revenge.

13:16.940 --> 13:17.920
Then...

13:17.920 --> 13:21.170
Don't say you'll bite everyone here to death!

13:23.050 --> 13:26.490
There are many ways to finish things.

13:26.810 --> 13:28.740
If we plan to live on,

13:29.050 --> 13:32.290
we should make choices 
that lead us to that future, right?!

13:33.540 --> 13:36.870
Without you, I would already be dead.

13:37.140 --> 13:41.100
I know that we were only able to 
make it through this because of you,

13:41.100 --> 13:44.240
and I'm thankful that you 
listened to my request.

13:44.240 --> 13:44.850
It's just...

13:44.850 --> 13:46.420
Enough. Enough.

13:47.010 --> 13:50.380
My traveling companion 
is truly a troublesome one.

13:52.170 --> 13:53.810
Do as you wish.

13:56.220 --> 13:57.260
Thank you.

13:58.310 --> 13:59.280
Ms. Nora.

13:59.280 --> 14:00.860
Y-Yes.

14:00.860 --> 14:02.940
This is my suggestion.

14:06.410 --> 14:08.060
Now, then.

14:08.060 --> 14:08.660
What?

14:08.970 --> 14:11.620
Why not tell me the truth now?

14:13.310 --> 14:16.620
Ms. Nora, I'd like you to decide 
what to do with the gold.

14:16.620 --> 14:17.400
Huh?

14:17.400 --> 14:23.210
Only, if we smuggle the gold into 
Ruvinheigen, it will rise ten-fold in value.

14:23.490 --> 14:25.670
In other words, six thousand Lumione.

14:25.670 --> 14:27.160
Six thousand...

14:27.160 --> 14:31.830
With that amount of money, we could save 
both ourselves and Remerio Trading.

14:34.670 --> 14:37.020
There wasn't enough gold.

14:37.020 --> 14:38.140
Oh?

14:38.500 --> 14:43.770
That wasn't anywhere near six hundred 
Lumione. It was closer to a hundred Lumione.

14:43.770 --> 14:47.940
If you split the gold with her, it would 
barely be enough to pay off your debt.

14:47.940 --> 14:51.160
There would be no profit 
if we did not smuggle it in.

14:51.440 --> 14:54.160
It looks like Remerio is 
in a really tough spot.

14:54.160 --> 14:58.730
The hundred Lumione worth of gold is 
probably barely enough for him to recover.

14:59.830 --> 15:03.790
He knew he wouldn't have 
enough money to pay us off.

15:03.790 --> 15:07.760
That's probably why he agreed 
to this plan in the first place...

15:09.020 --> 15:12.400
However, that was quite a lofty excuse.

15:12.400 --> 15:14.760
It made you sound like a saint.

15:15.120 --> 15:17.180
I meant more than half of what I said.

15:21.180 --> 15:22.310
Get on.

15:22.700 --> 15:24.220
Are you done questioning me?

15:24.220 --> 15:26.730
Your foolishness has merely
 rendered me speechless.

15:29.190 --> 15:34.370
Well, we're not really saving 
Remerio Trading for their sake.

15:34.370 --> 15:35.360
Oh?

15:35.360 --> 15:37.700
It's to further our own profits.

15:37.700 --> 15:39.960
Further our profits?

15:40.300 --> 15:42.610
Even I cannot fathom how you would do that.

15:42.610 --> 15:45.340
Merchants can turn all sorts 
of things into money.

15:45.340 --> 15:47.620
I should show you my good side 
every once in a while.

15:47.620 --> 15:49.450
What do you plan to do?

15:49.450 --> 15:51.090
We're not just saving them.

15:51.410 --> 15:54.550
We'll have Remerio Trading 
pay for what they've done.

15:54.970 --> 15:57.930
Leave the rest to me.

16:02.050 --> 16:06.310
Then, I think I will drink some wine 
and wait for your good news.

16:15.630 --> 16:17.180
Five hundred, you say?!

16:17.180 --> 16:21.710
Yes, I'd like you to buy the gold 
we smuggled in for five hundred Lumione.

16:21.710 --> 16:24.940
I provided enough money for a hundred Lumione.

16:24.940 --> 16:26.630
How could I pay five hundred for it?!

16:26.630 --> 16:30.170
Too expensive? Then, let's see.

16:31.310 --> 16:32.880
Hey! What are you doing?!

16:35.270 --> 16:40.180
I'll take the money you prepared to run with 
and sell the gold to someone else.

16:41.310 --> 16:43.800
You can split the payment over ten years.

16:43.800 --> 16:46.600
You created such a large trading company,

16:46.600 --> 16:49.510
I'm sure five hundred Lumione 
will be nothing to you in the long run.

16:52.150 --> 16:54.280
Well, then. Let's prepare 
the statement of debt.

16:54.280 --> 16:57.090
U-Um, who will be owed the money?

16:57.090 --> 16:58.930
The Rowen Merchant Association.

16:59.450 --> 17:03.910
I may not be able to collect 
all five hundred Lumione as an individual,

17:03.910 --> 17:06.630
but the association will be sure 
to collect it in full within ten years.

17:07.750 --> 17:10.670
What a fearsome man.

17:12.730 --> 17:17.050
I was so worried! You unfilial son!

17:18.180 --> 17:23.060
Good job coming back 
to your home in Ruvinheigen.

17:24.490 --> 17:25.810
However...

17:25.810 --> 17:28.930
You managed to come up with something 
like this when you had no money?

17:28.930 --> 17:30.460
What kind of bad things did you do?

17:30.460 --> 17:32.500
I didn't do much.

17:32.500 --> 17:36.490
Well, I just managed to 
bring in some gold. Literally.

17:36.490 --> 17:38.200
Gold?

17:40.920 --> 17:45.910
Sounds good. I'll buy this loan off of you. 
It's worth thirty Lumione up front.

17:45.910 --> 17:49.960
You'll get another hundred once 
Remerio Trading gets back on their feet.

17:49.960 --> 17:52.750
That much? Thank you very much!

17:54.310 --> 17:57.720
That should be enough 
to turn some profit, right?

17:57.720 --> 17:58.810
Well...

18:00.520 --> 18:02.470
So, in reality?

18:02.470 --> 18:04.880
With the trouble we caused 
the merchant association,

18:04.880 --> 18:09.650
the debt payment, Nora's share, 
and a few other things...

18:09.650 --> 18:12.020
Well, we've broken even.

18:13.510 --> 18:17.650
What? What happened to further profits?

18:17.650 --> 18:20.170
Those profits were what allowed us 
to recover from the loss.

18:22.670 --> 18:23.830
Now, then.

18:24.850 --> 18:27.810
There are two things I wish to ask.

18:28.290 --> 18:29.220
What is it?

18:29.630 --> 18:32.270
How much do you trust that girl?

18:34.310 --> 18:37.670
Even if Nora runs with the gold, 
we'll be able to chase after her.

18:37.670 --> 18:41.260
That was the extent of my distrust 
when I handed her the gold.

18:42.090 --> 18:44.900
Well, I guess that is about it.

18:44.900 --> 18:46.220
Your second question?

18:48.800 --> 18:53.770
I'll answer anything you ask. 
I owe you so much this time.

18:55.820 --> 18:57.150
Aren't you going to ask?

19:01.060 --> 19:03.700
I believe the girl should be returning soon.

19:20.430 --> 19:21.130
Do you...

19:22.150 --> 19:24.100
Do you remember?

19:24.930 --> 19:30.980
Whose name did you call 
when I faced the girl and her dog?

19:31.870 --> 19:35.030
I was so angry that I did not hear it.

19:35.030 --> 19:38.450
But you must have called one of our names.

19:40.730 --> 19:42.230
Do you remember?

19:46.330 --> 19:47.870
I called your name.

19:51.210 --> 19:53.000
You just lied!

19:53.000 --> 19:54.100
Yeah, I did.

19:54.540 --> 19:56.910
I actually don't remember, myself.

19:57.900 --> 19:58.910
Even so...

19:59.670 --> 20:04.180
At the time, I think I called your name.

20:04.530 --> 20:06.270
There was no time to lose.

20:06.740 --> 20:09.590
I'm sure I would have chosen 
your name without realizing it.

20:10.220 --> 20:11.350
That's because...

20:14.100 --> 20:17.940
That's because your name is 
a little shorter than hers.

20:19.780 --> 20:24.620
On top of that, even if I called out Nora 
quickly, you would've realized it.

20:24.620 --> 20:27.000
But Holo can be said in a split second.

20:27.000 --> 20:30.100
You just may not have heard it 
because you were angry.

20:30.100 --> 20:32.540
What do you think? I think it's a convincing...

20:32.970 --> 20:34.250
Shut up!

20:34.250 --> 20:35.460
Ouch...

20:36.040 --> 20:39.340
You called my name 
merely because it was shorter?!

20:39.650 --> 20:41.210
You fool!

20:41.210 --> 20:45.010
What makes me so angry is that 
you seriously believe that!

20:47.750 --> 20:49.240
H-Hey...

20:52.830 --> 20:55.400
Come, try calling out a name. {Note: This is ambiguous on purpose. To confirm which name he calls out. But it gets drowned out by the bells.}

21:33.290 --> 21:34.950
Hey, you!

21:43.350 --> 21:44.140
Holo.

21:46.140 --> 21:48.610
Holo is definitely much easier to say.

21:53.920 --> 21:54.990
Fool!

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
Episode 13

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
Supper of Three and Afternoon of Two

23:45.770 --> 23:49.540
Next Episode: 
"Supper of Three and Afternoon of Two"
